            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Gail Cobile"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We made this over Labor Day weekend. I thought the strawberry concentrate was quite tart so added some bar syrup instead of sugar. Just the right amount of sweetness and a very refrishing drink with enough of a difference to make them again! Thanks for a GREAT Drink, Pam!!",
            "datePublished": "2010-10-01T04:37:23.907Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BigShotsMom"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I didn't rate this originally because I didn't follow the recipe exactly - I couldn't find strawberry juice concentrate so I substituted raspberry juice concentrate and I used raspberries instead of strawberries. We loved it and I have made it that same way a couple of times. Thanks for a great idea, Pam!",
            "datePublished": "2010-09-30T19:27:43.387Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "CookinKim"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I just joined so I could rate this recipe. I made it several times over the summer and I really liked it. I've even tried it with different fruit combinations and liquors. I keep coming back to this combination. I have never rated a recipe on this site, but I lurk on the Recipe Exchange (buzz?) and came here after I saw a bad review of this recipe. I hope someone else will try it and give it a better rating.",
            "datePublished": "2010-09-30T19:07:07.460Z"
          },
          {
