            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Far too sweet, especially if adding liquor. Reminded me of a cheap bar drink and the whipped cream was way too much. My guests all passed on this one for our cocktail mixer.",
