            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Pam Ziegler Lutz"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I am the submitter of this recipe. It is a sweet drink, and it goes down easy. I refer to it as an \"adult milkshake\" because that's what it reminds me of. I hope you enjoy it!",
